title: Parliamentary Control of the Army
subtitle: At a concrete military case, or when the Sejm refused the law of the project: full civilian oversight or a limited reform.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: parliament_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_parliament_army_oversight.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_security_rules && PolishProjects.armyOversightAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card parliament.army_oversight (technical reference 16.3, 17.10, 17.12.4; card catalogue 7.5): 1 T; it prepares
// the one project of civilian control, which the agenda then puts to the Sejm; the cabinet executes it. A law the
// Sejm refused is not filed again unchanged, and the same scope never gives a second +0.05.
PolishProjects.armyOversightView(Q);
!}

= Parliamentary control of the army

[+ pl_ao_line +]

There are no paid "explanations of the minister" and no postponement; closing the card is free.

- @civilian_oversight
- @limited_reform
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@civilian_oversight
title: Fuller civilian oversight
subtitle: In the offer full civilian oversight (+2 on the army scale from −2 to +2); after the law costs the budget 1 unit a month for three months; then the group grows more loyal to the legal authorities (+0.05).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.armyOversightStatus(Q, 'civilian_oversight').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ao_civilian_oversight_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.armyOversightChoose(Q, 'civilian_oversight');
!}
go-to: result

@limited_reform
title: A limited reform
subtitle: In the offer a compromise on the army (the middle of the scale), which Piast, NPR and the Christian Democrats accept more easily; costs the budget 1 unit a month for two months; then the group grows a little more loyal (+0.025).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.armyOversightStatus(Q, 'limited_reform').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ao_limited_reform_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.armyOversightChoose(Q, 'limited_reform');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Parliamentary control of the army

